## Screenshots / notes for reviewers

Walking to the start tile follows the Port Sarim stile on `main`. As a 2004 reference only, LostCity's content scripts (MIT, https://github.com/LostCityRS/Content, `skill_agility/scripts/shortcuts.rs2`) also choose the side by coordinate and put the player on the start tile before the climb.

